  "description": "KUKULCAN.Kernel.JsonEngine is a lightweight class library that provides JSON serialization, deserialization, and schema-aware processing for Kukulcan Software Designer applications.\n\t\t\tIt offers typed converters, configuration binding, and extension points to standardize data exchange between core services, plugins, and persistence layers.\n\t\t\tUse it to read/write JSON configurations, validate payloads, map domain types, and implement custom converters for platform-specific objects.\n\t\t\tDesigned to be modular and have few dependencies, it integrates seamlessly into the Kukulcan Software Designer ecosystem as the standard JSON engine for kernel-level data handling and interoperability.",
